{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09de60f7648059000bf21b368a5ae9dd1b10e079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, then the value of the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/d/16d8ff301811ace7d7547e135d9b6b7f5270d440.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=x^2+x-2xy+y^2-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"213\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/1/2b18f4bf8679450b0423e16124f7fbd6c9605b1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 2\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } -2\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } -1\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"386\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearranging the variables in the equation gives, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/73455fe1803cf95923d7c72f8e080460b83f9ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2xy+y^2+x-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"172\" height=\"18\" />. Factoring the equation gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecdd127951fa991ba173b979e49fb0e7cb196eb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)^2+(x-y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"19\" />. We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09de60f7648059000bf21b368a5ae9dd1b10e079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, therefore we can simplify the equation into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/5/c652118727558860203d756a58404287d64119af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)^2+1=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ec57a6373350472bd9be0c231923ceb315ae968.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\